  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Modernization Program of the Salto Grande Binational Hydropower Complex - Phase II-a</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Modernizacin del Complejo Hidroelctrico Binacional de Salto Grande  Etapa II-a</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de la Primera Operacin Individual de Prstamo (POIP) es contribuir a la descarbonizacin del sistema elctrico interconectado mediante la modernizacin del CHSG. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) contribuir a garantizar la confiabilidad y disponibilidad del CHSG; (ii) contribuir a extender la vida til del CHSG; y (iii) contribuir con la sostenibilidad ambiental y social del CHSG.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the First Individual Loan Operation (POIP) is to contribute to the decarbonization of the interconnected electricity system through the modernization of the CHSG. The specific objectives are: (i) to help ensure the reliability and availability of the CHSG; (ii) contribute to extending the useful life of the CHSG; and (iii) contribute to the environmental and social sustainability of the CHSG.</narrative>
  </description>
